    "detailed_description": "3D space multiplayer party game. In every single game, crews need to move the spaceship to the final within 40 minutes. Imposters need to stop crews from doing that.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPress F to interact, long press F to mine/repair;<br />\r\nClick the left mouse button to use the selected item;<br />\r\nLeft-click to use ice to add oxygen to the space suit;<br />\r\nLeft click to use energy can add energy to the space suit;<br />\r\nWhen both of them are wearing spacesuits, they can connect. The connecting person only consumes the braking oxygen of one person, and the connected person moves with the connecting person without consuming braking oxygen;<br />\r\nKinetic guns cause air leaks on spaceship and spacesuits, and repairs require consumable parts. Air leaks in space suits can only be repaired by others;<br />\r\nThe imposter presses the middle of the mouse to open the seethrough vision, and the imposter can craft things directly by pressing E in the spacesuit state.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has designed an EMP gun, and the effect is still being planned. I hope players can give me more suggestions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlpha testing QQ Group: 321173720",
    "about_the_game": "3D space multiplayer party game. In every single game, crews need to move the spaceship to the final within 40 minutes. Imposters need to stop crews from doing that.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPress F to interact, long press F to mine/repair;<br />\r\nClick the left mouse button to use the selected item;<br />\r\nLeft-click to use ice to add oxygen to the space suit;<br />\r\nLeft click to use energy can add energy to the space suit;<br />\r\nWhen both of them are wearing spacesuits, they can connect. The connecting person only consumes the braking oxygen of one person, and the connected person moves with the connecting person without consuming braking oxygen;<br />\r\nKinetic guns cause air leaks on spaceship and spacesuits, and repairs require consumable parts. Air leaks in space suits can only be repaired by others;<br />\r\nThe imposter presses the middle of the mouse to open the seethrough vision, and the imposter can craft things directly by pressing E in the spacesuit state.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has designed an EMP gun, and the effect is still being planned. I hope players can give me more suggestions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlpha testing QQ Group: 321173720",
